ng><br><strong>③.眶外角</strong><br><strong>④.颧突隆</strong><br><strong>⑤.口轮匝肌侧缘</strong><br><strong>⑥.颏结节</strong><br><strong>⑦.颏底</strong><br><br><strong>【支线 · 眼】</strong><br><strong>A.上眼睑 + 下眼睑上的交界</strong><br><br><strong>【支线 · 鼻】</strong><br><strong>B.从眉头到鼻底的交界</strong><br><br>可点击操作面板上的眼睛图标隐藏标注，更干净地观察明暗交界线。","modelId":"male_daben","modelRole":"reference","modelLabel":"大本","lessonTabLabel":"环形明暗"},"id":"L01"}